            subtitle: `Your first year as manager of a community bank’s branch in Maryvale, Phoenix: set the sales plan, serve the neighbourhood in its language, price loans fairly, lend in the tracts the Community Reinvestment Act measures, report cash honestly, explain deposit insurance, decide the satellite office and clean up the accounts nobody asked for.`,
            title: `FDIC Branch`,
            txt_cra: `CRA index`,
